.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# NOTE: state/, knowledge/, learning_log/, policy/history/, and audit/*.jsonl
# are intentionally NOT ignored. This project runs on ephemeral GitHub Actions
# runners (see .github/workflows/learning.yml) — nothing survives between
# runs except what's committed back to the repo, same pattern as NewsPulse's
# pipeline/publisher.py. If you ever move this back to running only on your
# own always-on machine, you can re-ignore these; until then, don't.
